This Si48 solid smoke case is reconstructed from the repository's Si64 PEXSI supercell and Si RT-TDDFT GPU input. It matches the 48-atom system size used to validate the multi-GPU RT-TDDFT implementation in PR #7026, but it is not a copy of that unpublished benchmark input.

The case runs only two electronic propagation steps. It checks that the multi-node cuSolverMp RT-TDDFT path completes; it is not a physical or performance reference calculation.
